Lila was a quiet girl who never tried new things. One day, her class went to a science fair. Lila was scared to present her project, but she remembered her teacher’s advice: “Try your best.” She took a deep breath and shared her invention. Her classmates clapped, and Lila felt proud. She learned that bravery is about facing fears.  

